I did some other reading about monster drops and it seems monsters
will *never* be given stuff like ?oEW; only items that the monster
itself can actually use (create monster, teleport, etc.). They *can*
get "oLS at low probability (as we all know) but the only way to get
it off them is by attacking when polymorphed as a nymph. And there's
no way to have known that in advance.

In my ascension run, I killed Rodney three on the way back up, twice
wasn't with stoning. The first time I got a random defensive item
(wand of teleport) and a misc item (potion of gain level), and in the
plane of earth I got another defensive item (potion of full healing)
and a misc item (potion of gain level). But if the monster can't use
it, you won't get it... unless I'm reading the source wrong again.

Of course, polypiling all the create monster and teleport scrolls
should get you whatever you need for AC.

